istant', 'content': "Now let me check if there's a metrics.json in the best directory to understand the hit patterns:\n", 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_b9169073799242738b942680', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'read_file', 'arguments': '{"file_path": "/inspire/qb-ilm/project/cq-scientific-cooperation-zone/public/ywang/meta-harness-evolver/project/test/project-bda/hoss-evolution-workspaces/Sanchez21/run-1/best/current/harness/outputs/metrics.json", "limit": 100}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_b9169073799242738b942680', 'content': '{\n  "content": "\\n\\nIMPORTANT: The file content has been truncated.\\nStatus: Showing lines 1-100 of 2233 total lines.\\nAction: Use \'offset\' and \'limit\' parameters to read specific sections.\\n\\n--- FILE CONTENT (truncated) ---\\n  1| {\\n  2|   \\"task\\": \\"perturb-genes-brief\\",\\n  3|   \\"data_name\\": \\"Sanchez21\\",\\n  4|   \\"measurement\\": \\"the change in tau protein level compared to the non-targeting control, using a total tau antibody\\",\\n  5|   \\"task_prompt\\": {\\n  6|     \\"Task\\": \\"identify genes that, when knocked out, either increase or decrease expression of endogenous tau protein levels in neurons\\",\\n  7|     \\"Measurement\\": \\"the change in tau protein level compared to the non-targeting control, using a total tau antibody\\"\\n  8|   },\\n  9|   \\"metrics\\": {\\n 10|     \\"test\\": {\\n 11|       \\"pool_size\\": 18469,\\n 12|       \\"rounds\\": 1,\\n 13|       \\"executed_rounds\\": 1,\\n 14|       \\"batch_size\\": 128,\\n 15|       \\"seed\\": 42,\\n 16|       \\"baseline_total_queries\\": 0,\\n 17|       \\"baseline_total_hits\\": 0,\\n 18|       \\"delta_queries\\": 128,\\n 19|       \\"delta_hits\\": 8,\\n 20|       \\"total_queries\\": 128,\\n 21|       \\"total_hits\\": 8,\\n 22|       \\"top_k\\": 924,\\n 23|       \\"hit_curve\\": {\\n 24|         \\"queries\\": [\\n 25|           0,\\n 26|           128\\n 27|         ],\\n 28|         \\"hits\\": [\\n 2